 "description": "Read one listed software product by its domain: what it does, its main features, monthly visits (global and US), Domain Rank, backlinks, pricing (paid/free/gated, starting price, model) and its niche with its rank there. Use it after risetive_find_competitors or risetive_list_niche_players to look at one product in depth; it does not search \u2014 pass an exact domain. Returns not-found for domains Risetive does not list. Works without signing in (small daily allowance, at most 5 rows per list); a free Risetive account returns full results.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
